Package: starflow-backend
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: systemd
Maintainer: Starflow Backend Maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Willie-Z/llm-benchmark
Description: Starflow LLM verification local backend
 Local proxy and static web service for the Starflow LLM verification tool.
 The service binds only to 127.0.0.1:8000 and starts through systemd.
